{"content":"{\"chapter_contract_id\":\"contract:v2-n-2-1:v2\",\"node_id\":\"v2_n_2_1\",\"schema_version\":\"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\"known_evidence_ids\":[],\"blocks\":[{\"block_id\":\"p_v2_n_2_1_001\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"本研究的实际适应症为原发性IgA肾病（IgAN）。本研究已确认的机制方向为靶向补体通路。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"block_id\":\"p_v2_n_2_1_002\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"临床问题：针对原发性IgA肾病（IgAN）试验参与者，本适应症当前的疾病负担与治疗困境为：【缺口：background.clinical_problem：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"block_id\":\"p_v2_n_2_1_003\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"当前标准治疗（SOC）：本研究应列出本适应症项目化、可核查的SOC。当前事实为：【缺口：background.standard_of_care：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"block_id\":\"p_v2_n_2_1_004\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"未满足的临床需求：本适应症人群具体、非泛化的未满足需求为：【缺口：background.unmet_need：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"block_id\":\"p_v2_n_2_1_005\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"本研究的证据缺口与拟解决的不确定性：现有证据无法回答、需由本研究回答的不确定性为：【缺口：background.rationale_uncertainty：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"eb430176f72a3c9dfd4d34ce4f1e4a9d42b1e7d8bbcce58fa09cb586c7642756"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:59005f4c730eb14fc9806f87d1e9872ed8ad7be2203dde20bca381712f1067cd:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:59005f4c730eb14fc9806f87d1e9872ed8ad7be2203dde20bca381712f1067cd:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"1e698c4814e45c259bb182cd88f26d815fb13284ac849f8d7ec213578dcf9874","prompt_sha256":"6ee815045fd91aa16ebcd3eefcf1f4ab03489b3dbfac9ca67d47ceb4be87aa84","provider_session_id":"732bc5ef-db15-46de-bb31-9e8555198740","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"